[03:30.62] This blue ain't blue
[03:32.14] It's velvet black
[03:34.01] A crooked mirror sky
[03:37.04] And we hum like stars
[03:38.94] And flicker off into the blank and void
[03:43.90] I feel your limbs; they pull me down
[03:47.34] I feel your limbs; they pull me down
[03:53.05] And now we're too far gone
